	(text "Dual FPC STM32<->Tang Nano 20K FPGA connection\nconfiguration. The STM32 side has two connectors\nwhere only one can be active at a time\n\n- Configuration 1: FPGA_FFC with SPI, QSPI, UART\nconnections.\n- Configuration 2: FPGA_FMC with:\n	- 16 bit muxed data\n	- and async FMC\nconfiguration resulting in a 64MB shared address\nspace between the STM32 & FPGA"
